{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:43:09+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T07:43:09+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"adidas AG","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Footwear & Accessories","country":"Germany","city":"Herzogenaurach","website":"https://www.adidas-group.com","employees":64394,"summary":"adidas AG, together with its subsidiaries, designs, develops, produces, and markets a range of athletic and sports lifestyle products in Europe, Greater China, Japan, South Korea, Latin America, North America, and internationally. The company offers footwear and apparel, as well as accessories and gear, including bags, balls, sunglasses, and fitness equipment under the adidas brand; golf footwear and apparel under the adidas Golf brand; and outdoor footwear under the Five Ten brand. It sells its products through its own retail stores, mono-branded franchise stores, shop-in-shops, joint ventures with retail partners, and co-branded stores, as well as through its wholesale and e-commerce platforms. The company was formerly known as adidas-Salomon AG and changed its name to adidas AG in June 2006. adidas AG was founded in 1920 and is headquartered in Herzogenaurach, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"adidas AG, avec ses filiales, conçoit, développe, produit et commercialise une gamme de produits sportifs et de style de vie sportif en Europe, en Grande Chine, au Japon, en Corée du Sud, en Amérique latine, en Amérique du Nord et à l'international. La société propose des chaussures et des vêtements, ainsi que des accessoires et des équipements, y compris des sacs, des balles, des lunettes de soleil et des équipements de fitness sous la marque adidas; chaussures de golf et vêtements sous la marque adidas Golf; et chaussures de plein air sous la marque Five Ten. Elle vend ses produits par l'intermédiaire de ses p